From 6e7378425b09285303ac17b87e48d07e60af26b3 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: MiaAI Lab <83042094+MiaAI-Lab@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 27 Nov 2026 11:28:42 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] inkling2: fuse prompt loop gate_prep and direct ck8_128_row
 plane stores (after PR #6)

1. Fuse prompt rank-64 loop gate_prep normalization into
   tf_ink2_loop_gate_down_rows (after plotarmordev PR #6), eliminating
   the separate gate_prep launch and [rows, 2H] BF16 round-trip.
2. Add tf_ck8_128_row_split in ck_lane.cu to write the 4 or 6 fused
   prompt attention planes directly from registers when
   TF_INKLING2_ATTN_FP8_TC=1, eliminating m.s.fused staging and the
   tf_ink2_split_cols launch.
---
 zig/kernels/cuda/ck_lane.cu              | 30 ++++++++++++++++++--
 zig/kernels/cuda/inkling2/loop.cu        | 35 +++++++++++++++++++++---
 zig/src/families/inkling2/loop.zig       | 26 ++++++++++++------
 zig/src/families/inkling2/mini_model.zig |  3 ++
 zig/src/families/inkling2/mini_visit.zig | 28 +++++++++++++++++--
 5 files changed, 104 insertions(+), 18 deletions(-)

